{"name":"Blowout","hex":"#658499","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"blowout","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A sudden puncturing of a pneumatic tyre/tire.","A sudden release of oil and gas from a well."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blowout"}],"entries":[{"title":"Blow Out","blocks":[{"text":"Blow Out is a 1981 American neo-noir mystery thriller film written and directed by Brian De Palma. It stars John Travolta as a sound technician from Philadelphia who, while recording sounds for a low-budget slasher film, unintentionally captures audio evidence of an assassination. Nancy Allen stars as Sally Bedina, a young woman involved in the crime. The supporting cast includes John Lithgow and Dennis Franz."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/ce/Blow_outENG.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blow_Out"},{"title":"The Blow Out","blocks":[{"text":"The Blow Out is a 1936 American animated comedy short film directed by Fred Avery. The short was released on April 4, 1936. It is the 68th film in the Looney Tunes series and the fifth cartoon to star Porky Pig in his first solo appearance."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/ab/The_Blow_Out.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Blow_Out"},{"title":"Blowout (well drilling)","blocks":[{"text":"A blowout is the uncontrolled release of crude oil and/or natural gas from an oil well or gas well after pressure control systems have failed. Modern wells have blowout preventers intended to prevent such an occurrence. An accidental spark during a blowout can lead to a catastrophic oil or gas fire."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Lucas_gusher.jpg/330px-Lucas_gusher.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blowout_(well_drilling)"},{"title":"Blowout (tire)","blocks":[{"text":"A blowout is a rapid, explosive loss of inflation pressure of a pneumatic tire."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Tireimpactdamage.jpg/330px-Tireimpactdamage.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blowout_(tire)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/OilReservoir.png/500px-OilReservoir.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/OilReservoir.png/500px-OilReservoir.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A petroleum trap. An irregularity (the trap) in a layer of impermeable rocks (the seal) retains upward-flowing petroleum, forming a reservoir.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOilReservoir.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/IXTOC_I_oil_well_blowout.jpg/500px-IXTOC_I_oil_well_blowout.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/IXTOC_I_oil_well_blowout.jpg/1280px-IXTOC_I_oil_well_blowout.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/IXTOC_I_oil_well_blowout.jpg/500px-IXTOC_I_oil_well_blowout.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Ixtoc I oil well blowout","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AIXTOC_I_oil_well_blowout.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Deepwater_Horizon_offshore_drilling_unit_on_fire_2010.jpg/500px-Deepwater_Horizon_offshore_drilling_unit_on_fire_2010.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Deepwater_Horizon_offshore_drilling_unit_on_fire_2010.jpg/1280px-Deepwater_Horizon_offshore_drilling_unit_on_fire_2010.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Deepwater_Horizon_offshore_drilling_unit_on_fire_2010.jpg/500px-Deepwater_Horizon_offshore_drilling_unit_on_fire_2010.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Macondo-1 well blowout on the Deepwater Horizon rig, 21 April 2010","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADeepwater_Horizon_offshore_drilling_unit_on_fire_2010.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Figure_2-_Subsea_Well_Containment_Response_Equipment_%287045774079%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Figure_2-_Subsea_Well_Containment_Response_Equipment_%287045774079%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Figure_2-_Subsea_Well_Containment_Response_Equipment_%287045774079%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Figure_2-_Subsea_Well_Containment_Response_Equipment_%287045774079%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Government Accountability Office diagram showing subsea well containment operations","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFigure_2-_Subsea_Well_Containment_Response_Equipment_(7045774079)_(cropped).jpg"}],"sounds":{"blowout":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/EN-AU_ck1_blowout.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e5/EN-AU_ck1_blowout.ogg/EN-AU_ck1_blowout.ogg.mp3"}]}}}